    "narrative": "The Austin Waves are positioned for a high-ceiling outing today, headlined by **Gunnar Henderson** (83.29), who represents our premier play against Buehler. **Gunnar Henderson** benefits from a massive 16% park boost and a favorable platoon advantage, making him the cornerstone of our lineup. Following closely is **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (71.37) and our outfield trio of **Jackson Merrill** (68.42), **Kyle Tucker** (67.93), and **Andy Pages** (66.87). **Jackson Merrill** and **Andy Pages** are particularly intriguing; despite the standard platoon considerations, both benefit from a slow delivery matchup against Rogers and Hudson, respectively, providing the critical stolen base potential we prioritize to maintain our competitive edge in that scarce category.\n\nWhile **Miguel Vargas** (43.25) was the most difficult exclusion from today\u2019s lineup, his projected efficiency against Sheehan ultimately fell short of our infield starters. Our decision to start **Nasim Nunez** (52.97) over **Miguel Vargas** rests on **Nasim Nunez**'s ability to provide stolen base utility, even though he faces a tough assignment against Hancock. We must remain cautious with **Liam Hicks** (42.69) and **Sam Antonacci** (46.11), both of whom are facing high-tier arms in Skenes and Sheehan. While their batting order slots provide some insulation, the elite skill of these opposing pitchers drags down their floor significantly. We are effectively betting on the individual talent of **Liam Hicks** and **Sam Antonacci** to manufacture runs despite the negative SP skill adjustments; ensure you are monitoring for any late-breaking weather patterns, as the high-stakes matchups for our primary bats are sensitive to cooling conditions.",
